Jocelyne Allen is a Japanese translator and interpreter who splits her time between Toronto and Tokyo. She has translated hundreds of short stories, novels, and manga, such as the Eisner Award-winning _Frankenstein_ by Junji Ito and the Harvey Award-winning _My Lesbian Experience with Loneliness_ by Nagata Kabi, and has also interpreted for Japan’s most celebrated authors and artists, including Sayaka Murata and Inio Asano.', 'gender': 'Female/Non-binary', 'age': None, 'primaryOccupations': ['Translator'], 'languageV2': 'English'}}, {'role': 'Translator (French)', 'node': {'id': 226523, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n226523-5yDZX3EDfa2r.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'Patrick Honnoré'}, 'description': "Patrick Honnoré is a translator. He studied modern literature at the University of Provence in France and received an MA in 1988. After that he came to Japan to study comparative sociology at the University of Tokyo. After working for private companies and the Embassy of Haiti, he is now engaged in translating Japanese fiction into French as a freelance translator. He has translated Dogra Magra by Kyusaku Yumeno, Histoired'un squelette by Eiki Matayoshi and God's Boat by Kaori Ekuni for JLPP.

(Source: JLPP)", 'gender': None, 'age': None, 'primaryOccupations': ['Translator'], 'languageV2': 'French'}}, {'role': 'Translator (German)', 'node': {'id': 226103, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n226103-T2cUQKHZQCQ4.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'Miyuki Tsuji'}, 'description': 'A Japanese to German translator and author.', 'gender': 'Female', 'age': 58, 'primaryOccupations': ['Translator'], 'languageV2': 'German'}}, {'role': 'Translator (French)', 'node': {'id': 253753, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/default.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'Yukari Maeda'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None, 'primaryOccupations': ['Translator'], 'languageV2': 'French'}}, {'role': 'Touch-up Art & Lettering (French)', 'node': {'id': 268724, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n268724-daxfTpjmgVRN.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'Kévin Druelle'}, 'description': '[Twitter](https://twitter.com/kevin_druelle)', 'gender': 'Male', 'age': None, 'primaryOccupations': ['Letterer'], 'languageV2': 'French'}}, {'role': 'Lettering (Spanish)', 'node': {'id': 292060, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n292060-7sjYNp0R0XF1.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'Oliva Osanz'}, 'description': '[Twitter](https://twitter.com/oliva_osanz) | [Bluesky](https://bsky.app/profile/olivaosanz.bsky.social)', 'gender': 'Female', 'age': None, 'primaryOccupations': ['Letterer', 'Touch-up Artist'], 'languageV2': 'Spanish'}}, {'role': 'Translator (Spanish)', 'node': {'id': 382442, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/default.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'María Reimondo Saá'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None, 'primaryOccupations': ['Translator'], 'languageV2': 'Spanish'}}]}

characters:
{'edges': [{'voiceActors': [{'id': 118475}, {'id': 116185}, {'id': 203266}, {'id': 158646}, {'id': 141260}], 'node': {'id': 257562, 'name': {'full': 'Hitori Gotou'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b257562-Ru35NYPfsqhY.png'}, 'description': 'Gotou Hitori is a shy, gloomy high-schooler who started learning guitar after seeing rock bands on TV, in the hope that she too could become as popular as them. However, after 2 years she has yet to make a single friend or join a band. She instead sits in her closet at home, recording guitar covers and posting them to her YouTube channel, "guitarhero", on which she has amassed a reasonable following.', 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '16'}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 126963}, {'id': 176945}, {'id': 184115}, {'id': 157477}, {'id': 134081}], 'node': {'id': 261674, 'name': {'full': 'Nijika Ijichi'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b261674-a8tJYvtzqWgC.png'}, 'description': 'An energetic and cheerful second-year high school student. She is the drummer of Kessoku Band and the organizer who takes care of [Hitori](https://anilist.co/character/257562). She has an older sister, [Seika](https://anilist.co/character/289054), who is the manager of the live house "STARRY" and has a special feeling for the live house.', 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '17'}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 213951}, {'id': 244217}, {'id': 194549}, {'id': 370066}, {'id': 132376}], 'node': {'id': 264529, 'name': {'full': 'Ryou Yamada'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264529-BvEusZnJLD2Y.png'}, 'description': "A cool and solitary second year of high school. She is in charge of the bass of Kessoku Band. She's the best friend of [Nijika](https://anilist.co/character/261674). Her hobbies are out of the ordinary, and she rejoices when called a weirdo. She lives with a wealthy family, but she spends much of her money on instruments and always runs out of money. She occasionally eats weeds to get rid of her hunger.", 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '17'}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 132768}, {'id': 262679}, {'id': 257475}, {'id': 317158}, {'id': 105710}], 'node': {'id': 266041, 'name': {'full': 'Ikuyo Kita'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b266041-1HKgjJGP2MmM.png'}, 'description': 'A bright and popular first year of high school. She is in charge of the guitar and vocals of Kessoku Band. She is a cheerful character who likes to interact with people and can talk to her with a smile without hesitation, even when she meets her for the first time. She longs for [Ryo](https://anilist.co/character/264529), and her feelings can go too far. She often takes photos and uploads to Isosta.', 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '16'}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 119616}, {'id': 241496}, {'id': 116755}, {'id': 231384}], 'node': {'id': 291639, 'name': {'full': 'Kikuri Hiroi'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b291639-VYrixXvuwLqx.png'}, 'description': 'Bassist and vocalist of the band "SICK HACK".

Always drunk to forget about life's downsides.', 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '25'}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 108639}, {'id': 197407}, {'id': 181977}, {'id': 102533}], 'node': {'id': 289054, 'name': {'full': 'Seika Ijichi'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289054-UnScwd5RkqBk.png'}, 'description': 'Nijika's older sister and manager of the live house "STARRY".', 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '29-'}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 109131}, {'id': 248721}, {'id': 157478}], 'node': {'id': 289055, 'name': {'full': 'PA-san'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289055-khOP70WdXl2V.jpg'}, 'description': '__Height:__ 162cm

