staff:
{'edges': [{'role': 'Story', 'node': {'id': 113197, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n113197-X66tfc42LOuP.png'}, 'name': {'full': 'Wataru Watari'}, 'description': '[Twitter](https://twitter.com/watariwataru)

Wataru is a light novel writer who is best known for being the author of [Yahari Ore no Seishun Love Comedy wa Machigatteiru.](https://anilist.co/manga/70171/Yahari-Ore-no-Seishun-Love-Comedy-wa-Machigatteiru/) In March of 2009, he graduated from Meiji University in Communication and Information.

He initially decided to become a light novel writer because he was having difficulty finding a job. He is currently working at a company as a salaryman while being a part-time writer, with no plans of making writing his full-time occupation.', 'gender': 'Male', 'age': 39, 'primaryOccupations': ['Writer'], 'languageV2': 'Japanese'}}, {'role': 'Illustration', 'node': {'id': 114844, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n114844-fXN9BWKYpQiU.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'Ponkan 8'}, 'description': '[Twitter](https://twitter.com/ponkan_8) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/ponkan_8/)', 'gender': None, 'age': None, 'primaryOccupations': ['Illustrator'], 'languageV2': 'Japanese'}}, {'role': 'Translator (English)', 'node': {'id': 220278, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n220278-quJq9gJwCmYR.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'Jennifer Ward'}, 'description': "Jennifer is a Canada-based translator who has been translating manga since 2013 and light novels since 2014. She's worked on series such as Nodame Cantabile, Seven Shakespeares, My Youth Romantic Comedy is Wrong, as I Expected, Rokka: Braves of the Six Flowers and Magical Girl Raising Project. She was influenced at an early age by watching her brothers play games like Final Fantasy and Metal Gear on the SNES. It's been her dream to work in the industry since middle school.", 'gender': 'Female', 'age': None, 'primaryOccupations': ['Translator'], 'languageV2': 'English'}}]}

