Jian Yi is a loud, boisterous individual who is constantly adding light and humour to situations, despite his not-so-happy background. Yi has been friends with [Zhan Zheng Xi](https://anilist.co/character/121621/Zhengxi-Zhan) since childhood and continues to be close with him.

~!Jian Yi grew up in a terrible childhood; his father had abandoned him and his mother when he was just a baby for reasons that are still unknown. As a result, his mother had to try and take care of him by herself; however, she did not provide him with the attention a typical child would need from a parent. For most of his childhood, he was actually taken care of by a nanny since his mother was never around.!~', 'gender': 'Male', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 121621, 'name': {'full': 'Zhengxi Zhan'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121621-NK6bM6UhgJKG.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 305658, 'name': {'full': 'Cheng He'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305658-jmzvKhepSrh7.png'}, 'description': "He Cheng is  Tian's older brother and he works under Jian Yi's father.", 'gender': 'Male', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 305659, 'name': {'full': 'Qiu'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b305659-HnK65s8WxL54.jpg'}, 'description': 'Brother Qiu is very tall, muscular, and has a tattoo on his right arm. His hair is an off white/light grey.', 'gender': 'Male', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 308140, 'name': {'full': 'She Li'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b308140-zqn8UknXXsvE.png'}, 'description': 'She Li is one of the main antagonists in 19 Days and is an enemy to Mo Guan Shan as well as He Tian.', 'gender': 'Male', 'age': None}}]}

