She has had a talent for games since childhood, and because of that talent, she doesn't get along well with others.

From her days as a promising player before her pro debut, perfect self-management, schedule and training, and high performance to match, she has done everything. Even so, it is said that she could not find a smile on her face. However, thanks to Song Eun-Sa, whom she met while preparing to become a pro gamer, she realizes that her talent is a gift. As soon as she debuted, she won the championship, so she is a top-tier player called the Empress. As she is a rare female player in her industry, her popularity is at an all-time high both at home and abroad.", 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '18'}}]}

