Mysterious looking female PA engineer with a mouth piercing. In her private life, she is active as a virtual Youtuber under the name "Otogi Alto" producing gameplay videos.', 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '24'}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 109131}], 'node': {'id': 289056, 'name': {'full': 'Jimihen'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289056-Eob1bSBYL1ry.png'}, 'description': 'The Gotou family dog.', 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 152199}], 'node': {'id': 289059, 'name': {'full': 'Futari Gotou'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289059-AbMjfO2YoThz.png'}, 'description': "Hitori's younger sister.", 'gender': 'Female', 'age': '5'}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 118402}], 'node': {'id': 289058, 'name': {'full': 'Michiyo Gotou'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289058-5RE0lhteKG3P.png'}, 'description': "Hitori and Futari's mother.", 'gender': 'Female', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 95820}], 'node': {'id': 289057, 'name': {'full': 'Naoki Gotou'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289057-kxpKjfUu0KDi.png'}, 'description': "Hitori and Futari's father.", 'gender': 'Male', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 124390}], 'node': {'id': 291640, 'name': {'full': 'Hitori no Fan 1-gou'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b291640-Xr48HmvalScG.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': 'Female', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 126579}], 'node': {'id': 291641, 'name': {'full': 'Hitori no Fan 2-gou'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b291641-dfxBEtM7tiBA.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': 'Female', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [{'id': 289555}], 'node': {'id': 289549, 'name': {'full': 'Death Metal Voice'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b289549-lFZItZsHofCS.png'}, 'descr