{'edges': [{'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 285802, 'name': {'full': 'Remilia Graupner'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b285802-hUIFFsU6xyhw.png'}, 'description': "The villainess's body has two souls: *Emi Kobayashi* & *Remilia Rose Graupner*. Because of Emi Kobayashi's knowledge of the game world of 「The Star Maiden And The Knight of Salvation」she changes the course of Remilia's life and establishes wonderful reputation for her as the duke's daughter.

The true Remilia was perfectly content to watch Emi live a happy life for the sake of both of them. However, when [Pina](https://anilist.co/character/306778/Blanche-Pina) undoes all of Emi's work, Remilia's soul reclaims control of her body in order to exact revenge.", 'gender': 'Female', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 306779, 'name': {'full': 'Angel'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b306779-ENYZP51LWpo7.png'}, 'description': 'The demon king who makes a deal with the villainess [Remilia](https://anilist.co/character/285802/Graupner-Remilia).', 'gender': 'Male', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 393605, 'name': {'full': 'Emi'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b393605-mHuafNBoMs6Z.jpg'}, 'description': None, 'gender': 'Female', 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 306778, 'name': {'full': 'Pina Blanche'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b306778-CCDNYPk9Yv0v.png'}, 'description': "The original main character of an otome game who is destined to save the world from the demon king and the villainess Remilia with help from her friends Willard, Claude, David, and others.
~!as the story goes, it's revealed that a Japanese person has been reincarnated in Pina's body!~", 'gender': 'Female', 'age': None}}]}

staff:
{'edges': [{'role': 'Story & Art', 'node': {'id': 97539, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/2539.jpg'}, 'name': {'full': 'Nobuyuki Fukumoto'}, 'description': '[Twitter](https://twitter.com/fukumoto_pro)

Nobuyuki Fukumoto is a Japanese manga artist well known throughout the Far East for his unique original gambling ideas, deep psychological analysis of characters and distinct artstyle. Yakuza and gambling are recurring themes in his manga.

In English language countries, he is most famous as the author of Akagi, a mahjong-related manga. In 1998, he won the Kodansha Manga Award for Tobaku Mokushiroku Kaiji. An onomatopoeia "zawa" (ざわ‥), meaning uneasy atmosphere, appears frequently in his comics and is considered Fukumoto's trademark.', 'gender': 'Male', 'age': 67, 'primaryOccupations': ['Mangaka'], 'languageV2': 'Japanese'}}]}

