characters:
{'edges': [{'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 16589, 'name': {'full': 'Toua Tokuchi'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16589-5V20DgoFpGRH.png'}, 'description': '__Height:__ 183 cm (5’11")

Toua is a successful gambler, and a pitcher in the game One Outs. After losing a game of One Outs for the first time , he joins the Lycaons with an odd contract, the One Outs contract, that decides Toua's pay based on his performance. As the Lycaons' famed star pitcher, he can pitch entire games without giving up a single hit.', 'gender': 'Male', 'age': '20'}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 18597, 'name': {'full': 'Satoshi Ideguchi'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18597-6gHsjPqi6WcG.png'}, 'description': "He is the catcher of the Saikyou Saitama Lycaons and he also notices Toua talents as he catches Toua's pitches.", 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 16727, 'name': {'full': 'Hiromichi Kojima'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b16727-OLjhNPCa7fGk.png'}, 'description': 'Kojima is the cleanup batter in the professional baseball team, Saikyou Saitama Lycaons. He is defeated by Toua during his time at the training camp as he challenged Toua to avenge his relief pitcher, Nakane. After his defeat, he goes into the forest to train himself mentally against Toua but as he is training he injures his wrist. Even with the injury he challenges Toua to a rematch with the bet that if he wins, he takes Toua&#039;s hand. He wins the match as he gets hit by the pitch making it a deadball, Toua admits defeat and Kojima makes Toua join the Lycaons. (source: wikipedia &amp; manga)', 'gender': None, 'age': '43'}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 18602, 'name': {'full': 'Itsuki Takami'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18602-ZPfi1diBf3qf.png'}, 'description': "One of the cleanup batters in the team &quot;Chiba Mariners&quot;, he is known to be a prodigy in baseball and his eyes have the best in motion vision in the baseball world. He is the best player in the team and is able to think of counters against Tokuchi's fastballs, until he is outwitted and his team loses.", 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 39872, 'name': {'full': 'Mitsuo Oikawa'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b39872-lUHqE31jja1D.png'}, 'description': 'Oikawa is the head of Saikyou Saitama Lycaons public relations. Unlike the rest of the Lycaons management, he seems to truly wish for Tokuchi&#039;s success.', 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 39678, 'name': {'full': 'Big Mama'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b39678-PlbCH91bQLtQ.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 18603, 'name': {'full': 'Dennis Johnson'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/18603.jpg'}, 'description': 'Johnson, a foreigner who joined the Bugaboos, is called the World&#039;s Fastest Man by stealing home from third base as the pitcher pitched to home.', 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 28494, 'name': {'full': 'Tsuneo Saikawa'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/28494.jpg'}, 'description': 'The owner of the Saikyou Saitama Lycaons team. He is more interested in gaining money than getting the Lycaons to win. He forms the One Outs contract with Toua Tokuchi but later on as he realises he is still losing money to Toua he adds more conditions to the contract. He has a few members of the team under his control as pawns that will do his bidding, few of them are the secretary, sales, scouts, scorekeepers and even the manager of the team.

(Source: Wikipedia)', 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 39683, 'name': {'full': 'Junichi Kawanaka'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b39683-csZ7GiSMmv8s.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 39869, 'name': {'full': 'Yuuzaburou Mihara'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/39869.jpg'}, 'description': 'The manager of the Saikyou Saitama Lycaons. Obediently obeys every order given to him by the owner, and is often likened to a dog for doing so.', 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 18598, 'name': {'full': 'John Muruwaka'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18598-BQ5QEJbN1gHa.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 39679, 'name': {'full': 'Brooklyn'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b39679-gC7hFLCnQnF9.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 39681, 'name': {'full': 'Imai'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b39681-xB56D3eepl5Y.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 39879, 'name': {'full': 'Tomas'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/39879.jpg'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 39880, 'name': {'full': 'Yoshida'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/39880.jpg'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node': {'id': 18599, 'name': {'full': 'Genzou Sugadaira'}, 'image': {'large': 'https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b18599-n5euS3EpGO30.png'}, 'description': None, 'gender': None, 'age': None}}, {'voiceActors': [], 'node'